      "widgets_values": [
        "{\n  \"subject_definitions\": \"<Picture 1> defines ONE adult woman Mia in a glossy opaque pearl-white fitted cyber suit with orange seams, slim armor and flat white boots. Its three views show the SAME woman. <Picture 2> defines the bright daytime rooftop platform and detailed futuristic city. <Picture 3> defines Mia's exact face and long dark brown half-tied hair. <Picture 4> defines the white-orange angular hardbody airship with cyan-core engines and open side hatch; it remains distant background above the roof. No other performers. <Video 1> supplies root positions, scale, broad facing direction and camera only, with deliberately unanimated joints.\",\n  \"summary\": \"Continue the prior character action shown by the rough guide toward the separately supplied native ending layout.\",\n  \"retention_analysis\": \"Keep Mia's face, white-orange suit, body proportions and daylight city stable. Replace every simple proxy body and box building with the referenced real woman and detailed architecture. The one rigid proxy is a positional guide only; freely animate its real replacement with natural steps, weight shifts, bent knees, arm swing and coherent hands. Keep two arms connected throughout turns. No slow motion, teleports, duplicated people or literal mannequins. One continuous shot. The extra native ending-layout guide specifies the ending composition. It is separate from the ordinary Picture references. Follow the rough video for camera and root positions, and let H3 invent natural bodily movement.\",\n  \"detailed_description\": \"0-0.9167 seconds: Continue Mia's ongoing rightward jog and tracking view from the previous movement. This opening is an overlap handle, not a new departure. 0.9167-2.1 seconds: Take two more connected running steps with matching momentum, then brake through bent knees and pivot toward the camera. 2.1-3.6 seconds: Plant the left foot and deliver ONE clean right-leg waist-high roundhouse kick, pelvis and shoulders turning together, both arms visibly balancing; retract the leg and place the foot on the floor coherently. 3.6-4.8 seconds: Follow through into a low forward-leaning crouch, LEFT palm touching the deck, right arm still visible as counterbalance. 4.8-6.0833 seconds: Hold the low pose with natural breath, lift eyes toward the gently orbiting camera and form a restrained closed-mouth roguish smirk. No standing up or extra kick.\",\n  \"overall_soundscape\": \"Open rooftop wind, distant airship engine, synchronized running or walking steps, restrained breathing and suit movement. No dialogue.\",\n  \"non_diegetic_music\": \"N/A\"\n}"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "value": "{\n  \"subject_definitions\": \"<Picture 1> defines ONE adult woman Mia in a glossy opaque pearl-white fitted cyber suit with orange seams, slim armor and flat white boots. Its three views show the SAME woman. <Picture 2> defines the bright daytime rooftop platform and detailed futuristic city. <Picture 3> defines Mia's exact face and long dark brown half-tied hair. <Picture 4> defines the white-orange angular hardbody airship with cyan-core engines and open side hatch; it remains distant background above the roof. No other performers. <Video 1> supplies root positions, scale, broad facing direction and camera only, with deliberately unanimated joints.\",\n  \"summary\": \"A continuous cinematic action study of Mia, with natural model-authored articulation. Continue the prior clip rather than resetting it.\",\n  \"retention_analysis\": \"Keep Mia's face, white-orange suit, body proportions and daylight city stable. Replace every simple proxy body and box building with the referenced real woman and detailed architecture. The one rigid proxy is a positional guide only; freely animate its real replacement with natural steps, weight shifts, bent knees, arm swing and coherent hands. Keep two arms connected throughout turns. No slow motion, teleports, duplicated people or literal mannequins. One continuous shot.\",\n  \"detailed_description\": \"0-0.9167 seconds: Continue Mia's ongoing rightward jog and tracking view from the previous movement. This opening is an overlap handle, not a new departure. 0.9167-2.1 seconds: Take two more connected running steps with matching momentum, then brake through bent knees and pivot toward the camera. 2.1-3.6 seconds: Plant the left foot and deliver ONE clean right-leg waist-high roundhouse kick, pelvis and shoulders turning together, both arms visibly balancing; retract the leg and place the foot on the floor coherently. 3.6-4.8 seconds: Follow through into a low forward-leaning crouch, LEFT palm touching the deck, right arm still visible as counterbalance. 4.8-6.0833 seconds: Hold the low pose with natural breath, lift eyes toward the gently orbiting camera and form a restrained closed-mouth roguish smirk. No standing up or extra kick.\",\n  \"overall_soundscape\": \"Open rooftop wind, distant airship engine, synchronized running or walking steps, restrained breathing and suit movement. No dialogue.\",\n  \"non_diegetic_music\": \"N/A\"\n}"
      }
